    {
      "name": "Squirming Embrace",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The galvo Strides, ending its movement sharing a space with another creature, and deals 3d6 Piercing Damage]{3d6 piercing damage plus 2d12 electricity damage} to the creature. The creature must attempt a Basic DC 28 Reflex Saving Throw save.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Swarm Shape",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The galvo collapses into a shapeless swarm of eels. It drops all held, worn, and carried items. While discorporated, the galvo can't use attack actions, but it can move through areas small enough for its individual eels to fit without having to Squeeze. It can use Swarm Shape again to coalesce back into its normal form.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
